REGENT OF POHUWATO

GORONTALO PROVINCE

REGIONAL REGULATION OF POHUWATO REGENCY NUMBER 6 OF 2018

CONCERNING

PROTECTION OF WOMEN AND CHILDREN VICTIMS OF VIOLENCE

BY THE GRACE OF GOD ALMIGHTY

REGENT OF POHUWATO,

Considering:
a. that in order to restore the dignity and honor of women and children victims of violence and to restore their social function, it is necessary to undertake protection efforts, empowerment of women, and rehabilitation of children victims of violence;
b. that based on Article 12 of Law 23 of 2014 concerning Regional Government, empowerment of women and protection of children is a mandatory governmental affair for regional governments;

C. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a and letter b, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning Protection of Women and Children Victims of Violence.

